      "text": "\n\nThis trip brings together very different settings. High-altitude Bogotá gives way to the green surroundings of Guatavita, followed by El Peñón rock and the streets of Medellín. Cartagena adds forts, colonial architecture and the Caribbean Sea, while Barú offers a few days at a slower pace, with fewer scheduled excursions.\n"
